WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.830
When do you work best?

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.670
Early morning, late at night, or surrounded by people?

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.030
Your calendar may answer differently.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:16.510
That's because a week fills up by itself: meetings cut the day into pieces, and to-dos sit in Slack, mail and your head.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.470
And no single method works for everyone.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.710
It's like shoes in the wrong size:

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.910
fine for an hour, painful all week.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:29.410
So AI becomes your productivity coach, at two levels.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.270
The big picture: what you own, what to stop, delegate or automate.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:41.230
And your day: energy, deep work in your best hours, distractions, and one place for every to-do.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:47.930
Then you choose methods that fit you, and your coach pushes back, kindly, with your own numbers.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:53.710
So in this adventure, you build a week that fits you, from your real calendar and your answers.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.410
And two routines keep it alive.
